<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Assets plans bonus issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Assets plans bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment and financial services company Australian Assets Corporation Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1-for-1 bonus issue in an effort to encourage a more active market in its shares.</p>
<p>The bonus issue would apply to shareholders registered at the close of business on November 11.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
